  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC C Strengthening farming communities&apos;resilienceto climate change in river deltas - PDC C Strengthening farming co</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDC C St&#xe4;rkande av jordbrukssamh&#xe4;llen mot         klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar i flodddeltan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A PDC C between between SIWI and VACNE aiming at strengthening the resilience of farming communities against climate change for food production sustainability in three provinces (Ha Nam, Thai Binh, Vinh Long) by 1) documentation and sensitization of climate change impact analysis; 2) improving understanding of relative vulnerability, the needs and relevant tools and methods to response at all levels.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett samarbete mellan SIWI och VACNE som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka motst&#xe5;ndskraften i jordbrukssamh&#xe4;llen mot klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar f&#xf6;r en mer h&#xe5;llbar livsmedelsproduktion i tre provinser</narrative>
  </description>
